# Avoid Unnecessary `cd`

When running shell commands, use the `working_directory` parameter on the Shell tool instead of prepending `cd <dir> &&`.

```powershell
# BAD
cd src-tauri && cargo check

# GOOD — set working_directory: "src-tauri" on the tool call
cargo check
```

Only use `cd` when you genuinely need to change the shell's persistent working directory for a subsequent stateful step that cannot use `working_directory`.
